{
    "title": "Call & SMS Blocker - Blacklist",
    "description": "Call and SMS blocker for blocking spam calls and texts. Built in SMS messaging for blocking spam texts.\r\n\r\nNotice: Blocking spam text messages requires the app to be the default SMS app.\r\n\r\nSpam blocking:\r\n* Spam blocking for calls by adding phone numbers to the blacklist.\r\n* Block everyone except contacts.\r\n* Block phone numbers using an area code.\r\n* Block private phone numbers.\r\n* Whitelist for phone numbers that should never be blocked.\r\n* Dual SIM support.\r\n* Call blocking log.\r\n\r\nSMS messaging:\r\n* Simple SMS text messaging app.\r\n* MMS messaging.\r\n* Block SMS using keywords.\r\n* Send SMS messages at a later time.\r\n* SMS blocking log.\r\n* SMS and MMS delivery reports.\r\n* Group chat.\r\n* Support for large size MMS messages.\r\n* Search option for your messages.\r\n* Emojis.\r\n* Backup and restore for all your messages.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Call and SMS blocker for blocking spam calls and texts. Built in SMS messaging for blocking spam texts.<br><br>Notice: Blocking spam text messages requires the app to be the default SMS app.<br><br>Spam blocking:<br>* Spam blocking for calls by adding phone numbers to the blacklist.<br>* Block everyone except contacts.<br>* Block phone numbers using an area code.<br>* Block private phone numbers.<br>* Whitelist for phone numbers that should never be blocked.<br>* Dual SIM support.<br>* Call blocking log.<br><br>SMS messaging:<br>* Simple SMS text messaging app.<br>* MMS messaging.<br>* Block SMS using keywords.<br>* Send SMS messages at a later time.<br>* SMS blocking log.<br>* SMS and MMS delivery reports.<br>* Group chat.<br>* Support for large size MMS messages.<br>* Search option for your messages.<br>* Emojis.<br>* Backup and restore for all your messages.",
